[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3082\u3046\u3059\u3050\u661F\u8A95\u796D\uFF01\n\u3000\u4ECA\u56DE\u3082\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u3092\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3066\u3001\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\n\u3000\u306A\u3063\u305F\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u306B\u8D08\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3001\u3084\u30FC\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The Starbirth Festival is almost here! I\u0027ve got to get gifts ready for everyone who\u0027s helped me out. I can\u0027t wait!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3001\u90AA\u9B54\u3059\u308B\u305E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, may I interrupt?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u3093\u306B\u3061\u306F\u3002\n\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u3055\u3093\u3001\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna! Hello there. Is Roman not with you today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9\u6BBF\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u79C1\u306F\u50CD\u304D\u3059\u304E\u3060\u304B\u3089\n\u4F11\u6687\u3092\u53D6\u308B\u3088\u3046\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u3066\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. Lord Brad insisted that I was working too much and ordered me to take some time off..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u4ECA\u306F\u79C1\u4E00\u4EBA\u3060\u3002\n\u79C1\u304C\u4F11\u6687\u306E\u9593\u306F\u3001\u304D\u3061\u3093\u3068\u4EE3\u5F79\u304C\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I\u0027m by myself today. Someone else is covering my duties while I\u0027m on leave."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3044\u3064\u3082\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u3055\u3093\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u304B\u3001\n\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u3055\u3093\u3092\u63A2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3070\u304B\u308A\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3001\n\u304A\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u3044\u308B\u306E\u306F\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u73CD\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s rare to see you alone! You\u0027re usually either with Roman or looking for him."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\n\u305D\u306E\u304A\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u88C5\u3044\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, Juna, that beautiful outfit...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8D64\u3044\u8863\u88C5\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u304A\u4F3C\u5408\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The red outfit suits you perfectly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8D64\u3044\u8863\u88C5\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u304A\u4F3C\u5408\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u307B\u3093\u3063\u3068\u3046\u306B\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The red outfit suits you perfectly! It\u0027s absolutely wonderful! You look so cute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307B\u3001\u8912\u3081\u3059\u304E\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you\u0027re praising me too much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3067\u3082\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3001\u304B\u3002\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...But... cute, you say? Thank you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u304A\u9854\u307E\u3067\u771F\u3063\u8D64\u306B\uFF01\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u306B\u306F\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u51DB\u3005\u3057\u3055\u3068\n\u3000\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3055\u304C\u5171\u5B58\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna\u0027s face is turning as red as her outfit! This outfit perfectly balances her dignified nature with her cuteness...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u811A\u90E8\u5206\u306B\u5207\u308C\u76EE\u304C\u3042\u3063\u3066\u52D5\u304D\u3084\u3059\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The slits make it look easy to move in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8170\u304B\u3089\u8DB3\u306B\u304B\u3051\u3066\u5207\u308C\u76EE\u304C\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\n\u3068\u3066\u3082\u52D5\u304D\u3084\u3059\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those slits from the waist down look like they\u0027d make it really easy to move around in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u306F\u83EF\u3084\u304B\u306A\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306A\u304F\u3001\n\u52D5\u304D\u3084\u3059\u3055\u3082\u517C\u306D\u5099\u3048\u305F\u3068\u3066\u3082\u826F\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. This outfit isn\u0027t just elegant\u2014it\u0027s also very practical for movement."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306B\u3074\u3063\u305F\u308A\u306A\u8863\u88C5\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s perfect for a knight like you, Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u3092\u62F5\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u3068\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306B\n\u611F\u8B1D\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3066\u306F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I must thank Mieke and Diona for making this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u306B\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s truly an outfit made for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u306B\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u4F5C\u3089\u308C\u305F\u3068\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3082\n\u904E\u8A00\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3068\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s truly an outfit made for you! I wouldn\u0027t be exaggerating to say it was designed specifically with you in mind!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u3001\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u306F\n\u79C1\u7528\u306B\u3068\u610F\u5320\u3001\u88FD\u4F5C\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, it was indeed designed and made specifically for me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u4EE5\u5916\u306E\u8AB0\u306B\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u304C\n\u7740\u3053\u306A\u305B\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\n\u3055\u3059\u304C\u306E\u7740\u3053\u306A\u3057\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who else could wear this outfit so perfectly? Your way of wearing it is absolutely magnificent!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u306E\u53CD\u5FDC\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308B\u3068\u306F\u2026\u2026\n\u3075\u3075\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u898B\u3066\u3044\u3066\u98FD\u304D\u306A\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wasn\u0027t expecting such an enthusiastic response... Hehe, you never cease to amuse me, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u305D\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u306F\u3001\u661F\u8A95\u306E\u4F7F\u8005\u306E\u3082\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that outfit you\u0027re wearing the Star Messenger\u0027s attire?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3001\u524D\u56DE\u306E\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\u7740\u305F\u4F7F\u8005\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u3082\u3046\u3059\u3050\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u306A\u306E\u3067\u2026\u2026\n\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3067\u3001\u307E\u305F\u7740\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, it\u0027s the Messenger outfit from the last Starbirth Festival! With the festival coming up... I got excited and put it on again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u304F\u4F3C\u5408\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\u2026\u2026\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It suits you well... Cute."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u3001\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u308B\u8857\u306E\u7A7A\u6C17\u306B\n\u6C34\u3092\u5DEE\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u3001\u3053\u306E\u88C5\u3044\u3067\u884C\u52D5\u3057\u3066\u306F\n\u3069\u3046\u304B\u3068\u6BBF\u4E0B\u306B\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "His Highness suggested I wear this outfit so as not to dampen the festive atmosphere in town."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u307E\u3067\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u3060\u304C\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\n\u7279\u306B\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308B\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Starbirth Festival is approaching. Is there anything you\u0027re particularly looking forward to, Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8857\u306E\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The atmosphere in town"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u308B\u8857\u306E\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u884C\u304D\u4EA4\u3046\u4EBA\u3001\u307F\u3093\u306A\u697D\u3057\u305D\u3046\u3067\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The festive atmosphere in town! Everyone walking around looks so happy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3002\n\u79C1\u3082\u3001\u8857\u306E\u3042\u306E\u96F0\u56F2\u6C17\u304C\u597D\u304D\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I agree. I enjoy that atmosphere as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u4ED5\u4E8B\u306B\u3082\u529B\u304C\u5165\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It makes me want to work even harder as a knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The presents"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u8D08\u3063\u305F\u308A\u8D08\u3089\u308C\u305F\u308A\u3001\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The presents! Both giving and receiving them is so exciting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u306F\u308A\u305D\u3053\u306F\u5916\u305B\u306A\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s certainly an essential part."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8D08\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306E\u559C\u3073\u306F\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\n\u8D08\u308B\u5074\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4F55\u3092\u7528\u610F\u3057\u305F\u3089\u76F8\u624B\u304C\u559C\u3076\u306E\u304B\n\u8003\u3048\u308B\u306E\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The joy of receiving gifts is wonderful, but thinking about what would make others happy when giving them is equally rewarding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98DF\u4E8B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The food"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u661F\u306E\u8A95\u751F\u3092\u795D\u3046\u3054\u3061\u305D\u3046\u304C\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m looking forward to all the special dishes celebrating the birth of the stars!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u79C1\u3082\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As am I."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7279\u306B\u3042\u306E\u3001\u8A95\u751F\u795D\u3044\u306E\u30B1\u30FC\u30AD\u304C\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3060\u3002\n\u5802\u3005\u3068\u30B1\u30FC\u30AD\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u3089\u308C\u308B\u6A5F\u4F1A\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\n\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Especially that celebratory cake. It\u0027s not often I get to openly enjoy cake like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\n\u3000\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306E\u597D\u304D\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\n\u3000\u7518\u3044\u3082\u306E\u597D\u304D\u3082\u96A0\u3057\u3066\u308B\u306E\u304B\u306A\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Could it be that Juna not only likes cute things, but also has a secret sweet tooth...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\n\u3000\u306B\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u3092\u8D08\u308A\u305F\u3044\u306A\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u3060\uFF01\n\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3092\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u306B\u8A98\u304A\u3046\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I want to get Juna a present for the Starbirth Festival... I know! I\u0027ll invite her out!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u540D\u4ED8\u3051\u3066\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3084\n\u3000\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3001\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3067\u8ABF\u67FB\u5927\u4F5C\u6226\uFF01\n\u3000\u4F5C\u6226\u304C\u3070\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3057\u306A\u304D\u3083\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Operation: Investigate Juna\u0027s Likes and Wishes During Our Outing! I have to make sure she doesn\u0027t notice the plan!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u660E\u65E5\u3001\n\u3082\u3057\u4E88\u5B9A\u304C\u7A7A\u3044\u3066\u305F\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, if you\u0027re free tomorrow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u738B\u90FD\u3067\u304A\u8CB7\u3044\u7269\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you like to go shopping in the capital with me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u738B\u90FD\u3067\u304A\u8CB7\u3044\u7269\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you like to go shopping in the capital with me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u305E\u3002\u660E\u65E5\u3082\u4F11\u6687\u3060\u3002\n\u4F55\u304B\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d love to. I\u0027m still on leave tomorrow. Is there something specific you\u0027re looking for?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7279\u306B\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u304C\u3042\u308B\u308F\u3051\u3058\u3083\n\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u306A\u306E\u3067\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u308B\u8857\u306B\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3001\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nothing in particular, but I thought it would be nice to visit the town while it\u0027s all decorated for the Starbirth Festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3002\u304A\u4E92\u3044\u3001\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u7D20\u6575\u306A\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u7740\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3092\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3064\u304F\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Since we\u0027re both wearing such lovely outfits, let\u0027s make the most of the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u9078\u3073\u3092\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d like help choosing presents!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5E2B\u5320\u3084\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u3055\u3093\u306B\u8D08\u308B\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u9078\u3073\u3092\n\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\n\u79C1\u3068\u7570\u306A\u308B\u8996\u70B9\u3092\u304A\u6301\u3061\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u306E\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d like help choosing presents for Master and Roman! I think you\u0027d have a different perspective than me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u69CB\u308F\u306A\u3044\u304C\u3001\u79C1\u3067\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\uFF1F\n\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\u30DE\u30EA\u30AA\u30F3\u3084\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u306E\u65B9\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t mind, but are you sure about me? Wouldn\u0027t Marion or Ryza be better for this...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u56DE\u306B\u3064\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3066\u306F\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304C\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304D\u3083\u30C0\u30E1\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304C\u7D50\u8AD6\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For this, it has to be you! It absolutely must be you! You\u0027re the only choice!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u306F\u3001\n\u671F\u5F85\u306B\u5FDC\u3048\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3051\u306B\u306F\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3044\u306A\u3002\n\u5834\u6240\u306F\u738B\u90FD\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-when you put it that way, I can\u0027t let you down. We\u0027ll meet in the capital then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3068\u30C7\u30FC\u30C8\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s go on a date!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3068\u30C7\u30FC\u30C8\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s go on a date!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u3001\u30C7\u30FC\u30C8\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u308F\u3001\u79C1\u3068\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u95A2\u4FC2\u306F\u3044\u3063\u305F\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A d-date!? W-what exactly is our relationship...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308F\u308F\u3001\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u9593\u9055\u3048\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01\n\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3001\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF01\uFF01\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3067\u8CD1\u308F\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3001\u304A\u53CB\u9054\u3068\u3057\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahh, I\u0027m sorry, that came out wrong! I meant let\u0027s go out together!! As friends, to see the Starbirth Festival!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3044\u3044\u306A\u3002\u884C\u3053\u3046\u3002\n\u5834\u6240\u306F\u738B\u90FD\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, that sounds nice. Let\u0027s do that. We\u0027ll meet in the capital."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u306F\u3001\u660E\u65E5\u3092\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m looking forward to tomorrow then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3088\u30FC\u3057\uFF01\u3000\u4ECA\u5E74\u3082\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u306E\u6E96\u5099\u306B\n\u3000\u53D6\u308A\u639B\u304B\u308D\u3046\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Alright! Time to start preparing presents!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u660E\u65E5\u306E\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3067\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u304C\n\u3000\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3044\u306A\u3002\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u88C5\u3044\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3068\n\u3000\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u2026\u2026\u7DCA\u5F35\u3059\u308B\u304B\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I hope I can figure out what Juna wants during our outing tomorrow. Going out with Juna in her beautiful outfit... I might get nervous...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]